# The planted lost update (transfer=racy): two transfers overlap and one SET overwrites the
# other's. Fixed by the atomic Lua transfer (the default build); this file checks it stays fixed.
# Written in the seed form (M86); the command list below is the one W= was written against, so
# a later command list replays the same composition, resolved by command id (M98).
# commands: anytime_read eventually_serves finally_summary first_accounts parallel_driver_set parallel_driver_transfer serial_driver_rewrite
# expect: ok
disk=none dseed=1 | run W=0000002a,p4,q2,r100
